  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-catalog\" style=\"background: repeat rgb(255, 255, 255); color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px; padding: 20px;\">\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEic8uD1SEvjeXAbEULdGvNOZgul5AwEc-FUwgurDacmlQk5FVckGe_1RxLIyapk6prZSVRvUAcJYHquQjSgI5sWAZ17dQegD9rTx_qoFmGQEwfTtmmRxhWLEmUrLszjYfUK7TlFHex_aaMvA_UF4HVawWzZHy8C1ypzWbaT8ZDrVtXOMdUV50R_jC32hHGb\" style=\"box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0px 10px 30px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n\n    <h2 style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;\">BONG報第 384 期 • 目錄</h2>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; padding: 0px 10px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/e_24.html\">封面圖</a></h3><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/e.html\">編輯室ê話</a></h3>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; padding: 0px 10px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台語政策推動聯盟專題</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">26</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/blog-post_1.html\">第二組： 台語日常化</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">主講／許慧如、劉承賢、<br />曾偉旻、薛丞宏</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">30</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/ti.html\">第三組： 後一間 台語學校tī佗位?</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">主講／張博洋、董力玄、<br />黃淑君</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">34</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/e_86.html\">第四組： 台語復振 需要ê法律初探</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">主講／何信翰、蔣念祖、<br />何宗勳</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">38</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/e-ng.html\">第五組： 台語教學ê ǹg望</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">主講／洪鈺彬、黃振彬、<br />游勝榮、宋宜蓁</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">做伙來唸詩</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">1</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/blog-post.html\">露螺</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 高朝明</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">2</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/blog-post_24.html\">心願</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 林云祺</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">2</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/luan-tshun-hong.html\">Luān Tshun-hong</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 雁翎</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">41</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/e_48.html\">花園ê氣味</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ Khun--ko</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">42</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/blog-post_90.html\">問風</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 洪惠玟</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">阿瑞 --ā話仙</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">4</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/blog-post_66.html\">頭鬃拍薄</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 藍春瑞</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">是按怎án-ne生</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">6</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/an-ne-e.html\">阿公ê囡仔伴</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 洪明道</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台灣人寫真</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">10</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/e-tap-tap.html\">後龍阿公ê ta̍p-ta̍p滴滴</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 陳掄瑜</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台譯se̍h-se̍h唸</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">12</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/seh-seh-kam-e-tang.html\">譯者對談：世界經典台譯， kám ē-tàng參考華語版？</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 吳孟儒</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">讀冊開講</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">16</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/blog-post_30.html\">《我有一个夢》、《獨立宣言》出版感想</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 倪振豪</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台語sa攏有</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">20</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/sa-tie.html\">建立活tī台灣ê儀式感</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">主講／鄭家和 &nbsp;<br /> 記錄／Huī-kun</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">生活ê藝術</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">22</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/03/e_7.html\">田園離療日誌——驚蟄篇（一）</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 鄭清和</div>\n                        </div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEizHqil4kYU2uD4dgzN92Z57eTjbkOEDoRhIAHjTjD51ggFOzdC57-LiUVCpQCErEbbz5rFzsT_i6ZB4YKPu4sRqAIsHQW1pWWEBpE1eyMIFhHwQvy_YLOsXy5PwN16p5c3wwfMZsQrOS3QKrQtkj8TQ3iQLxSb-5YQi2-2-g5dbCWyJdhD_ivU-GGyhe6E\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEizOlLtCt7CW-RLSUbVgOHkxnbOnB4vlbghn6FegSDNZCzm4ouoFh72sAr9LVUVWZwiNuw7h7klTzEj-5gWZ-VAXACw-ZxcMAJUjEuB8Q2dGfn9riBVq5OmLIi8kE11FCzA961vq4WtHd43tbnVZ_rvCu553faRoqncHpHlEn8rE3nMJryuwb7cH0kbSsA6\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjRyBwV2qmwN7lihYQhlBL6eAgLJJdsrrBpSPc4kQp89xrU4BHgspIC7QmrFX7evJavlOhLCjtPx4iKPH5nmu1zXESrMcUPD1Nk5Td9hL_ERq8i1GDid8ESy04C-wlfvSBJ8QVNCqwL6L9gbGheUXLO80iH15tahzf2iO2KPZac7MfdSTBotktfdC4gjC22\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 20px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 384期，2026年03月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div></div>"
  },
